WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

NOTE LumenAI 110-second explainer — caption-ready transcript. Timings match docs/marketing/VIDEO_STORYBOARD.md.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Some of the most important surfaces on a surgical instrument are also the hardest to see.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Borescope evidence can be hard to standardize, compare, review, and trace over time.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
LumenAI turns internal instrument inspection into structured, reviewable evidence.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Identify the instrument, capture the lumen image, and attach the context that makes it evidence.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Assistive analysis highlights areas for a reviewer — it never decides alone.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:11.000
When an approved baseline exists, the current inspection sits right beside it.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:22.000
Uncertain or higher-risk findings route to a qualified reviewer.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:34.000
Every decision is recorded with rationale, timestamps, permissions, and an audit trail.

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:44.000
Findings become trends across instruments, vendors, sites, and time.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:50.000
LumenAI. Better visibility. Better evidence. Better decisions.
